1
00:00:00,746 --> 00:00:03,616
(Penny:)Even if I had slept with him,
so what? Everyone has a past.

2
00:00:03,616 --> 00:00:04,446
(clears throat)

3
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:07,180
(Penny:)Almost everyone has a past.

4
00:00:07,186 --> 00:00:08,616
(Bernadette:)Come on, look
how pretty you are.

5
00:00:08,621 --> 00:00:10,651
(Bernadette:)I'm sure this isn't
the first girl to hate you.

6
00:00:10,656 --> 00:00:13,286
(Leonard:)It's not.

7
00:00:13,292 --> 00:00:15,962
(Bernadette:)And I'm sure
you can turn it around.

8
00:00:15,962 --> 00:00:18,192
(Penny:)How? You can't force someone
to like you.

9
00:00:18,197 --> 00:00:19,327
AMY:
What if you just

10
00:00:19,332 --> 00:00:20,932
(Amy:)hang around and act
like her friend

11
00:00:20,933 --> 00:00:23,633
(Amy:)until you wear her down?
I mean, next thing you know,

12
00:00:23,636 --> 00:00:27,476
(Amy:)you're in her home,
you're eating her food,
drinking her wine.

13
00:00:28,874 --> 00:00:30,474
(Penny:)No, that won't work.

14
00:00:30,476 --> 00:00:32,806
(Amy:)You're right. Cheers.

15
00:00:32,812 --> 00:00:34,142
(Bernadette:)Oh, I know.

16
00:00:34,146 --> 00:00:36,146
(Bernadette:)Why don't you use
your sales training

17
00:00:36,148 --> 00:00:38,348
(Bernadette:)to go back down there
and sell yourself?

18
00:00:38,351 --> 00:00:39,681
(Howard:)What?
Yeah.

19
00:00:39,685 --> 00:00:41,285
(Bernadette:)But instead of selling a drug,

20
00:00:41,287 --> 00:00:43,057
(Bernadette:)you'd be selling Penny--
it's cute.

21
00:00:43,055 --> 00:00:44,125
(Penny:)It's stupid.

22
00:00:44,123 --> 00:00:46,353
(Bernadette:)Well, maybe people
would like you more

23
00:00:46,359 --> 00:00:49,129
(Bernadette:)if you didn't crap
all over their ideas.

24
00:00:49,128 --> 00:00:51,728
(Amy:)I'm gonna go with
Penny on this one.

25
00:00:51,731 --> 00:00:55,371
(Amy:)Then again, why wouldn't I?
I mean, we go way back.

26
00:00:55,368 --> 00:00:58,298
(Penny:)Oh, my God.
I didn't used to like you.

27
00:00:58,304 --> 00:01:04,024
(Amy:)Shh. Amy's here now.

